ation\nNEWS\nThe Doctoral Office will be closed on October 29, 2026. Applications and inquiries received will be processed on the following Monday.\nThank you for your understanding!\nOffice Hours\nreachable by e-mail and by phone\nMonday till Thursday 9.00 - 12.00 a.m.\nE-mails and applications received on Fridays will be processed on Mondays.\nreachable in our office\nMonday and Thursday 9.00 - 12.00 a.m.\nOutside office hours, you can also drop documents in our red mailbox at Jungiusstra\u00dfe 9, ground floor on the left.\nContact\nDipl.-Phys. Irmgard Flick\nUniversity of Hamburg\nFachbereich Physik\nFachbereichsreferentin, Leitung Fachbereichsmanagement\nNotkestra\u00dfe 9, Room 3084, III. Etage\n22607 Hamburg\nTel: +49 40 2395-24057\nEmail: irmgard.flick\"AT\"uni-hamburg.de\nLast update: 21 October 2026\nFeedback\nLegal notice\nPrivacy statement\nAccessibility\nSite map\nUniversity of Hamburg\nInnovating and Cooperating for a Sustainable Future in a Digital Age\nStudies\nProspective students\nContinuing education\nResearch\nTeaching at UHH\nDoctoral studies\nJob opportunities\nKnowledge exchange\nUniversity\nExcellence\nFaculties\nAlumni\nContact\nCampus Navigator\nUHHApp\nEmergencies, safety and security\nAntidiscrimination\n\u00a9 2026 University of Hamburg. All rights reserved", "links": [["Zur Metanavigation", "https://www.physik.uni-hamburg.de/en/forschung/nachwuchs/promotion.html#meta"], ["Zur Hauptnavigation", "https://www.physik.uni-hamburg.de/en/forschung/nachwuchs/promotion.html#nav"], ["Zur Suche", "https://www.physik.uni-hamburg.de/en/forschung/nachwuchs/promotion.html#suche"], ["Zum Inhalt", "https://www.physik.uni-hamburg.de/en/forschung/nachwuchs/promotion.html#inhalt"], ["Zur Subnavigation", "https://www.physik.uni-hamburg.de/en/forschung/nachwuchs/promotion.html#subnav"], ["Zum Seitenfu\u00df", "https://www.physik.uni-hamburg.de/en/forschung/nachwuchs/promotion.html#fuss"], ["University of Hamburg", "https://www.uni-hamburg.de"], ["For journal